    },
    {
      "text": "Brutal for David Raya. Three Golden Gloves in a row, nineteen clean sheets last season, and no Yashin.",
      "say": "Brutal for David Raya. Three Golden Gloves in a row, nineteen clean sheets last season, and no Yashin.",
