    },
    {
      "text": "Courtois, Alisson and Donnarumma never have. Three more gone.",
      "say": "Kortwah, Aleesson and Donnahroomah never have. Three more gone.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "NO WORLD CUP",
